<p>Hi <%= recipientName %>,</p>
<p>We couldn't set up real-time backup for <strong><%= objectApiName %></strong> on the <strong><%= crmName %></strong> org, as part of your backup configuration <strong><%= backupConfigName %></strong>.</p>
<p><strong>Reason:</strong> <%= errorMessage %></p>
<% if (needsRecoveryRecordId) { %>
<p>To retry, please provide a sample record Id for <strong><%= objectApiName %></strong> so we can complete the setup.</p>
<% } else { %>
<p>Please retry the setup, or reach out if this keeps happening.</p>
<% } %>
